          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These metrics are computed from the on-device decision ledger and are never uploaded.": {
      "comment": "A description of the review insights displayed in the Review Insights view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Metriken werden aus dem Entscheidungsprotokoll auf dem Gerät berechnet und werden nie hochgeladen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces mesures sont calculées à partir du registre de décision du dispositif et ne sont jamais téléchargées."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu metrikler cihazdaki karar veritabanından hesaplanır ve asla sunucuya yüklenmez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This asset has not been explicitly reviewed yet.": {
      "comment": "A tooltip for a button that opens a new view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Objekt wurde noch nicht manuell geprüft."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet élément n'a pas encore été examiné."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu dosya henüz incelenmedi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This byte-identical copy was reviewed but intentionally left out of the Safety Plan.": {
      "comment": "A description of a decision that was reviewed but is not part of the Safety Plan.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese byte-identische Kopie wurde überprüft, wurde aber absichtlich aus dem Sicherheitsplan ausgeschlossen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie identique en octets a été examinée, mais a été intentionnellement omise du plan de sécurité."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu birebir kopya incelendi fakat bilerek Güvenlik Planı dışında bırakıldı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy is the protected keeper. Keptora blocks it from quarantine until another keeper is selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Kopie ist das geschützte Original. Keptora verhindert das Verschieben, bis ein anderes Original gewählt wird."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie est l’original protégé. Keptora empêche son déplacement tant qu’un autre original n’est pas sélectionné."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu dosya korunan orijinaldir. Başka bir orijinal seçilene kadar kurtarma kutusuna taşınması engellenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This group needs at least two members for synchronized comparison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Gruppe benötigt mindestens zwei Elemente für einen synchronisierten Vergleich."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce groupe a besoin d'au moins deux membres pour une comparaison synchronisée."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
