    "Keptora moves reviewed duplicate copies into a safe recovery bin. Your original photos are kept safe and untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keptora moves reviewed duplicate copies into a safe recovery bin. Your original photos are kept safe and untouched."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keptora incelenen kopyaları güvenli bir kurtarma kutusuna taşır. Orijinal fotoğraflarınız daima güvende ve dokunulmazdır."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keptora verschiebt überprüfte Kopien in einen sicheren Wiederherstellungsordner. Ihre Originalfotos bleiben unberührt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keptora déplace les copies examinées dans une zone de récupération sécurisée. Vos photos originales restent intactes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Original keeper photos remain in place. Every duplicate copy is verified before moving, and photo families (like RAW+JPEG or Live Photos) stay together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original keeper photos remain in place. Every duplicate copy is verified before moving, and photo families (like RAW+JPEG or Live Photos) stay together."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Korunan orijinal fotoğraflarınız yerinde kalır. Taşınmadan önce her kopya doğrulanır ve fotoğraf aileleri (RAW+JPEG veya Live Photo) bir arada korunur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geschützte Originalfotos bleiben erhalten. Jede Kopie wird vor dem Verschieben geprüft, und Fotofamilien (wie RAW+JPEG oder Live Photos) bleiben zusammen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les photos originales protégées restent en place. Chaque copie est vérifiée avant déplacement et les groupes de photos (RAW+JPEG ou Live Photos) restent associés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can restore these files at any time from History & Restore.": {
      "localizations": {
